Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.19,0:00:36.47,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And our days of laughter
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.55,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Become all the more precious to us.
