Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:21.97,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's been really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:27.14,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,She's always been saying that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:30.19,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,This time, I can actually tell how happy she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:33.48,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,She... really is cheerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.36,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Could it be love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:38.49,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sawako...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.53,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,My Sawako...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.66,0:01:43.04,Default-alt,Mom,0,0,0,,{\move(960,960,960,1030,860,1260)}Look what you've done, Dear! What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:47.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm really happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:53.84,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,After experiencing all this happiness, I'm starting\N to forget the times when I didn't know how it felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:55.80,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Let me keep this moment for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:02.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I don't exactly get what he meant\N by that, but it really made me happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:09.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I get the feeling I'm using up all the happiness allotted for my lifetime...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:13.69,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:20.95,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What?! You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.28,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yoshida, the one with the small eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.29,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,That's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:27.54,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,I heard that she was practically\N uncontrollable during middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.75,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,She made teachers cry and punched all the guys in her class!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:34.92,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I've done far worse than that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.72,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Also, I don't think my eyes are {\i1}that{\i0\fscx30} {\r} small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.43,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yano-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.22,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,So she wasn't just sleeping around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:45.56,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,I know! Dating a hundred guys in middle school is just crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:49.39,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You really think there are a hundred guys who could satisfy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.98,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,If you do, bring them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.65,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I'll see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:57.53,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Geez, stories of my fighting days aren't anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.74,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Well, that's why they're called rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:02.53,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And my eyes aren't as small as everyone thinks they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:05.49,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,They're certainly smaller than\N what you make them out to be, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:06.99,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.25,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,They're all lies. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:11.00,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Same with the bit about it all coming from Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.34,Default,Both,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.18,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm asking who started the rumor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.10,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Who was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:27.97,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.77,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:33.10,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That's what everyone's been saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:39.53,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That Sadako is using Kazehaya and you two to become popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:45.66,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,That's just insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.62,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,B-But, want to ask her anyway, just to be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.66,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Right, so that ramen was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:54.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san! Yoshida-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:55.50,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,M-Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.26,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Morning, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:02.59,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear? I punched all of the guys in my class back in middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:08.01,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,And as for me, I really like guys. I dated\N a hundred of them during middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:11.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Wow... Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You two are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.73,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm...
