Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:22.82,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yoshida-san, if you don't mind, would you like to use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:23.49,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:25.16,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:29.33,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Last night, I took notes on the main\N points that'll be covered on the midterm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:31.91,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If you could put it to good use...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:35.04,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,200% innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.83,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'll gladly use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:38.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Hey... Yano-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:43.88,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I thought about going out and renting a\N movie to get better at telling ghost stories...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:47.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Do you think you could recommend something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.72,Default,Both,0,0,0,,200% innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:52.06,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:54.19,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Could you let me get a copy of those notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:54.89,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:56.35,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,I'll take care of your cleaning duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:57.56,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.27,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:04:59.44,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Is it okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:00.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:02.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:06.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Nothing makes me happier than being able to help other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:08.49,Default,Both,0,0,0,,300% innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:10.62,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:13.33,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,G-Good morning, Sanada-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:14.21,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:18.88,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun's kind of late today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.34,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnArial Black\fs30\c&H806854&\fax0.05\frx5\fry4\frz356.041\pos(957,355)}P.E. TEACHER'S OFFICE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:21.34,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,You don't believe me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:24.13,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,I swear, I saw them last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:25.42,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Tiny old men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:29.14,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That's great, Pin... but I really want to get to my classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:32.85,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,I was drinking last night, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:43.36,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,There were a bunch of them, running around my cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:46.28,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Round, and round, and round, and round...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.99,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,And one by one, they started to climb into my cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:51.03,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Pin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.66,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You're making me late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.96,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,And those guys are really smart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.42,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.25,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,So, how is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.75,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,I'm talking about that Kuronuma girl, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.05,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.14,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,All these weird things have been\N happening to me ever since I looked her in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.43,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,You must know a lot about her,\N considering you sit right next to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.56,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Does she have the ability to curse, or-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.56,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I only believe what I see with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.73,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,The Kuronuma I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.44,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,...is an optimistic, wonderful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:27.15,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.66,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,...hook up with her or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:33.28,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,W-What are you blushing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.62,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me you actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.49,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.49,0:06:37.37,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:40.54,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Seriously, I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:45.80,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:50.38,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What's with his taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.47,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And hear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.39,0:06:58.27,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:00.06,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:02.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,M-Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:03.27,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,What made you so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:07.03,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Pin wouldn't shut up about some tiny old men he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.07,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.78,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,His forehead is showing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:09.24,Default-alt,Kaze,0,0,0,,I don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.33,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Is she... acting normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:17.66,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Is it because I said that thing about keeping her for myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.95,0:07:19.00,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,His forehead...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:22.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I want to see it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:25.00,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Did you hook up with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:27.46,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.92,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I can't even look her in the face anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.38,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Oh, I missed it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.34,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That's too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:43.52,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I feel my heart beating faster as my days of happiness go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:46.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder what everyone else thinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.07,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder if they like being with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:52.53,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I really hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:59.66,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I... really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:11.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Until now, I've never even thought of anything\N like that, since it's been natural for me to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:26.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Since that day, my heart has been full\N of feelings I've never experienced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:29.36,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want to treasure them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:33.78,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It feels like I've just received my first gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.83,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey, Yano-san, Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.04,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.00,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.04,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,A lot of people have been talking about you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.00,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.84,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,And these rumors are getting worse by the day, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:56.68,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Someone was saying you knocked over an\N old man and made him bleed, Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:57.68,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:01.27,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,There was a time when I helped an\N old guy get up after he tripped, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.60,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,And Yano-san, they were saying that you work as a prostitute...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.52,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Why the hell would I do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:09.77,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Obviously we don't believe any of it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:12.57,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,We heard the one who's spreading these rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:15.53,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,...is Kuronuma-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:16.66,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:17.91,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,No doubt about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:22.95,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We got worried about why these rumors were just springing up out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:27.21,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Don't you think she's horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:30.09,Default,Girl3,0,0,0,,I can't believe she'd start a rumor like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:31.96,Default,Girl3,0,0,0,,How could she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:35.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I feel like people are even more frightened of me nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.18,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:41.97,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Shino-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:42.77,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:49.52,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Hey... I've been hearing a lot of rumors about you lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:55.99,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So even Shino-chan heard the rumors about me being\N able to sense ghosts and having the ability to curse people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:10:01.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yes... Misunderstandings are a little difficult to clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:02.99,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Misunderstandings?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:05.20,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:10.38,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I should have known. There's no way Sadako would spread rumors about her own friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:14.96,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... it doesn't really bother me as much as it used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:17.72,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,People around me are being really kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:22.10,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I feel like you've softened up, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:22.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:28.02,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Why does everyone keep blaming Sadako for all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:32.44,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I guess all three of us tend to stand out in a bad way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:37.69,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,It's understandable people may say bad things about us, but\N the stuff they're saying about Sadako is different from usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.28,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,But it's great...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:41.49,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,You were able to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:43.37,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,It was Yano-san and Yoshida-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-They're not my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.96,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:53.54,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.05,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Hang on, I want to hear the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.46,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:58.42,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.26,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,They're... not your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:01.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:07.39,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Friendship... is the bond that exists\N between Yoshida-san and Yano-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:14.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,When I look at them, I can really\N tell they care a lot about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:18.90,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That's why... I feel I shouldn't get too far\N ahead of myself by calling them "friends".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.41,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.91,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I really, really like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:28.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If a day comes when I'll become friends with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:31.37,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...that would be wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.13,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnDomfortress Casual\fs110\fscx120\c&H000000&\frz15.598\pos(847,138)}TOP SECRET
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:33.13,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fnLauren C. Brown\fs180\c&H000000&\frz15.598\pos(519,928)}Training\N Menu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.13,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fnLauren C. Brown\fs85\c&H000000&\frz15.598\pos(753,735)}Training\N Menu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.13,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fnLauren C. Brown\fs75\b1\c&H000000&\pos(1131,960)\frz14.713}Don't slack off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.13,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:38.63,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,A secret training menu for the baseball team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.26,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Pass it on to Ryu for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:44.55,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Don't screw with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:45.89,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.47,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,This really pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:51.39,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What an awful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:53.56,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Calm down, Chizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-They're not my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:12:02.15,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,We've yet to ask Sadako what she meant by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.28,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Let's face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:09.75,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,If someone asked us what kind of relationship we\N had with Sadako, wouldn't it be difficult to answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:12.29,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:16.79,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:19.30,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.34,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They're always smiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:23.72,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.47,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Could you come and take a seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:27.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:31.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or do they look a little sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:39.69,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,This is really important, so promise us you won't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:41.90,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.16,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I mean, we like you, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:48.99,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,How do you feel about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.54,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Do you feel the same way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:59.29,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,R-Rather than "like"...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:03.01,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Rather than saying I "like" you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:03.88,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'd say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:04.93,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:10.18,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:12.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:17.81,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Sorry to trouble you, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:20.32,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,D-Don't worry about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:27.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Was I... able to get through to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.53,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,With just those words?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.62,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,We like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:37.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I should be really happy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:42.67,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I still think... they look sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:47.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And that makes me sad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:51.68,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's something I can do to cheer them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:56.18,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,And now she's getting full of herself\N and having Yano and Yoshida back her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:57.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,"Back her up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:02.52,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,And she's totally using Kazehaya, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:03.82,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:08.03,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-This person sounds pretty influential...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:09.20,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.41,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:11.28,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:15.95,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fnBolide\fs53\bord4\frz2\c&H0E070B&\3c&H93396D&\pos(94,772)}Kuronuma\N Sawako\N {\fsp1}villainy\N of a\N witch
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.78,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,A-All of a sudden, the subject of\N my rumors have changed completely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:20.92,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,But hey, the bad rumors about\N Yano and Yoshida are really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.71,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Bad rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:25.96,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm... having them back me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:29.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So that's why they looked so sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.47,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They were hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:34.18,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's totally Sadako's fault, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.27,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.98,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's because she's walking around like she owns the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:44.73,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Same with Kazehaya. He's going to lose his\N popularity if he keeps hanging around with Sadako like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:51.24,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's... because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:15:00.58,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san and Yoshida-san have always been kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:05.34,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They're willing to be with me out of pure kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:07.71,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.43,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's because she's walking around like she owns the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:17.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm hurting the people I'm around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:26.36,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If I talk to Kazehaya-kun, will I end up hurting\N him the same way I did Yano-san and Yoshida-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.90,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Did you hear Pin's story about the tiny old men?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:30.32,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Huh? I've actually seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:31.36,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.24,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:32.86,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:34.03,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,They looked just like Zen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:34.70,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.78,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,Of course we're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Would it... be better if I keep my distance from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:57.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Am I... not allowed to be close to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:15.70,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What's with those eyes?! You look\N like you were crying your eyes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:19.91,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Look who's talking! You look like you were up crying all night!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.88,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Hey, Yano-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:29.71,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:33.88,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Do you think Sadako's the one who started those rumors about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.22,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,To be honest, after hearing what she had to say yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:41.14,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I don't really know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:41.81,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:47.98,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Because at the very least, she doesn't "like" us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:51.69,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Since that's exactly what you asked her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:59.12,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,If she said "yes", it'd follow that\N she's not the one spreading the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:03.46,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,And that's why you asked her that question, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:10.84,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I didn't have a doubt in my mind\N that Sadako wasn't the one behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:12.34,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.97,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm thinking, "What will I ever do if she {\i1}is{\i0\fscx30} {\r} the one"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.93,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I really want to believe she isn't someone who would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:24.94,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And I hate myself for doubting her for even a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,M-Morning....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.45,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:40.74,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Their eyes are red...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.25,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:49.08,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm the one who made you two sad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.50,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What... do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:55.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm going ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.22,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.93,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,She apologized to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:05.48,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What does she mean by "make us sad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:08.65,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Could it be... she really is the one who's spreading the rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.61,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,C-Cut it out! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:13.65,Default-alt,Ayane,0,0,0,,{\move(960,960,960,1030,650,1050)}I don't want to think about it either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:20.20,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Could it be that she was\N apologizing for yesterday... for not liking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:24.08,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Either way, those words really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.54,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yeah, they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:28.87,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Maybe I was full of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:33.00,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I'd always thought of myself as someone pretty important to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:38.05,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Same here. I thought she liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:44.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They're hurt far more than I thought they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:50.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want to find out who's spreading\N the rumors and put an end to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:54.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I need to let them know that Yano-san and\N Yoshida-san aren't backing me up or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:57.65,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's just that they're really nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:19:01.70,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I know how to clear up a misunderstanding now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.99,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... I can't find them...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:07.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The people spreading the rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:10.71,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want them to return to the way they normally are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:17.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Their normal, cheerful, laughing selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.56,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They're the ones who really want to cry, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:37.07,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:38.99,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.07,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Did I do something to make you sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:45.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Sorry... I have something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:47.74,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You were crying earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:51.50,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,And I get the feeling you're avoiding me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:58.00,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Did I do something to make you sad... or to even make you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.05,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,If I did, just tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.38,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,N-No, you didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.59,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:04.64,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.60,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:11.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No matter what happens in the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:14.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I could never bring myself to hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:20.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It just isn't possible, no matter what may happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:22.90,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:27.33,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You've got a test coming up. How much can you slack off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:28.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:30.87,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.67,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You've never avoided me no matter what I did, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:45.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... if I stay by his side, I'll only cause trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.60,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll only cause trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:51.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But I don't want to avoid him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:54.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It'll be better to keep my distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But I want to be by his side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:00.61,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Is avoiding them the right thing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:02.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Or isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:04.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:06.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I just don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:08.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:10.91,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:25.97,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-RO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}{\kf54}So{\kf43}no {\kf44}so{\kf30}ra {\kf21}i{\kf17}p{\kf26}pa{\kf31}i {\kf22}no {\kf41}ka{\kf21}mi{\kf38}hi{\kf46}ko{\kf41}u{\kf45}ki{\kf37} {\kf49}gu{\kf49}ra{\kf26}i {\kf41}ni {\kf62}na{\kf21}t{\kf252}te{\kf40}
